# Configuration file for the Imago plugins library.
#
# This file defines a series of menu entries that will be added to
# the "Plugins" menu of any Imago frame.
# Each menu entry is given in the following format:
# menuname, "Command text", classname
#
# comments starts with #

# the following point to the default plugin in the template.
# it should be replaced with your own plugins
Plugins>Demos, "Hello Imago Demo", my.plugin.HelloImagoPlugin
